# Scrape newly deployed services

A new or newly enabled service is not done until Prometheus scrapes it
and the series reach Mimir.

- Prefer the process's native `/metrics`. Otherwise enable the matching
  nixpkgs exporter (postgres, redis, pgbouncer, …).
- Add a `scrapeConfigs` job in `services/prometheus.nix` (interval, tailnet
  target, `host` relabel like neighbouring jobs). Open the metrics port on
  `tailscale0` only.
- Do not publish exporters on a public NIC. `openFirewall = false` unless
  the module already scopes to Tailscale (`docs/monitoring.md`).
- Update the scrape list in `docs/services/prometheus.md`.
- Then add alerts and a dashboard. Do not drop the new series unless
  nothing will read them (`docs/adr/2026-09-05-mimir-series-headroom.md`).
